e_derivation":"REFUSE","hold":"NONE","unchanged_since_crossing_001":true,"withhold":"NONE"},"predecessor":{"canonical_envelope_sha256":"abda8d645a6b9c3f92f0ea887c99a723fc89cabcf398343a8865885171a081dd","chain":["c56e445e3aa834af9663ae8d2b3e3058892b18f264d62d5f35e01326f14a2d5a","abda8d645a6b9c3f92f0ea887c99a723fc89cabcf398343a8865885171a081dd"],"crossing_sequence":2,"public_key_sha256":"1618fc707296274417a5170512a936621d13f2c28cf2dce800af24e38e88559c","same_key":true},"schema":"di-crossing.crossing.v0.1","self_regulation":["Additive only inside /Users/markomarkota/DI_CROSSING_CLAUDE_001 and this execution's own memory directory.","The Body's admitted entrypoint body_reality_contact_membrane.py is invoked exactly once, as technical executor under the bearer's OPERATIONAL_AUTHORIZATION as expressed in the authorization statement; the invocation is not a Body Act by this execution.","The socket path is outside the Body carrier; bytecode writing is disabled so no residue enters the carrier.","This execution technically holds both ends of the socket; the observation, journal, and raw carrier are the Body mechanism's own, written only by its own append-only operation in its fixed living-state root.","No other Body file is written; no manifest, state, index, or lineage object of the Body is touched.","Inside this root, no file already present is rewritten or removed, except MANIFEST.sha256, whose predecessor bytes are preserved byte-exact at lineage/MANIFEST_REVISION_002.sha256 and journaled first.","The Body's own verify-state command is run afterwards as verification only; failure is reported as failure with residue left visible."],"sequence":3},"signature_base64":""},"envelope_canonical_sha256":"0f048d8f4cca04e6ed042ecc75f85abee43b7e1d1222c3dffe53d5af78718946","public_key_sha256":"1618fc707296274417a5170512a936621d13f2c28cf2dce800af24e38e88559c","requested_effect":"RECIPIENT_LOCAL_OBSERVATION_ONLY; no admission requested","schema":"di-crossing.wire.v0.1","source_claim":"